  "swiftAnchor": "leanring-buddy/OverlayWindow.swift:495-568",
  "description": "Seam 9 (FlightPath): the buddy's bezier flight. input.operation picks the function. 'sample' gives position, rotation and scale at a linear progress (OverlayWindow.swift:537); 'flightDuration' gives the flight length in seconds. Coordinates are DIPs with a top-left origin, like the SwiftUI points the Swift uses. Expected values are worked out from the Swift lines, never by running the code under test: distance d = hypot(end - start) (:504-506); duration = min(max(d / 800, 0.6), 1.4) (:510); control point P1 = (midpoint.x, midpoint.y - min(0.2 d, 80)) (:517-522); eased t = 3p² - 2p³ for linear progress p (:540); position = (1-t)²·P0 + 2(1-t)t·P1 + t²·P2 (:543-549); rotation = atan2 of the tangent 2(1-t)(P1-P0) + 2t(P2-P1), in degrees, + 90 (:555-561); scale = 1 + 0.3·sin(p·π), from the linear progress, not the eased one (:565-566). Eased t at p = 0.25 / 0.5 / 0.75 is 0.15625 / 0.5 / 0.84375. Parity spec PNT-06.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "short-hop-p0",
      "branch": "sample-short-hop",
      "note": "Short hop (100,200) → (400,200): d = 300, arc 0.2·300 = 60 (under the 80 cap), P1 = (250, 140). p = 0 → t = 0, position = P0. Tangent 2(P1-P0) = (300, -120); atan2(-120, 300) = -21.8014°, + 90 = 68.1986°. sin(0) = 0 → scale 1.",
      "input": { "operation": "sample", "start": { "x": 100, "y": 200 }, "end": { "x": 400, "y": 200 }, "linearProgress": 0 },
      "expected": { "x": 100, "y": 200, "rotationDegrees": 68.19859051364818, "scale": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "short-hop-p025",
      "branch": "sample-short-hop",
      "note": "t = 0.15625, 1-t = 0.84375. P1.x is the midpoint x, so x = 100 + 300t = 146.875. y = 200 - 2·60·t(1-t) = 200 - 120·0.1318359375 = 184.1796875. Tangent = (300, 2·0.84375·(-60) + 2·0.15625·60) = (300, -82.5); atan2 = -15.3763°, + 90 = 74.6237°. Scale 1 + 0.3·sin(π/4) = 1.2121320.",
      "input": { "operation": "sample", "start": { "x": 100, "y": 200 }, "end": { "x": 400, "y": 200 }, "linearProgress": 0.25 },
      "expected": { "x": 146.875, "y": 184.1796875, "rotationDegrees": 74.62374875117382, "scale": 1.2121320343559643 }
    },
